// Companion to fail_assert_no_args.tr: `assert()` called with 3+ arguments
// must also be rejected -- assert takes a condition and an optional
// message, never more. Before the fix this silently compiled (extra args
// beyond the message were just ignored by CodegenIntrinsic).

fn main(): int {
    assert(true, "msg", "extra", "more");
    return 0;
}
